      "image": "assets/images/54688/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Add macaroni and cook until tender, about 8 minutes. Drain and rinse under cold running water.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dEiFjzOfuYpg4QZ66ZSR3z8Yn0A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/54688-kims-macaroni-salad-VAT-007-step-02-cc4bf2a1add74f42b1fddbfb9ef08b46.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/54688/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix together mayonnaise, vinegar, sugar, salt, pepper, green onions, and jalapeño peppers in a large bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
